{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12201240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1220124001:0":{"text":"Ce... ci...","source_cn":"……萨……赛西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C95B0E235D02D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220124002:0":{"text":"Honestly, you made me wait for so long!","source_cn":"真是的，居然让我等了这么久！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB02198FA7930AC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220124003:0":{"text":"Uh... ah...","source_cn":"啊……啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE884EE72FDDD0CFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220124004:0":{"text":"... Yes, I missed you too.","source_cn":"……嗯，我也很想你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x141D5A7ACDD93DFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220124005:0":{"text":"Look at us now, both like this. Let's not run away anymore, alright?","source_cn":"你瞧，我们现在都已经是这个样子了，就别再逃跑啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE43B169D64DF261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220124006:0":{"text":"... Ce... cilia...","source_cn":"……塞西……莉亚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A0BAB1A0931051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220124007:0":{"text":"...Well, then. Shall we finally take this chance to begin our journey?","source_cn":"……不过，正好。趁现在的机会，我们要不要出发呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x454CD656D987DD1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220124008:0":{"text":"You've always dreamt of an adventure, just like in those songs—wandering through golden fields, crossing cascading waterfalls and rainbows, gazing over the deep scars that mark the land.","source_cn":"你一直想去远方冒险，就像歌里唱的那样，去看金色的原野，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29FF6219DA8A6295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220124009:0":{"text":"You've waited for so long. The door is open now, and nothing can hold you back. I'll be by your side.","source_cn":"你已经等了这么久。现在房门的锁已经打开了，再没有东西能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35CB1890789AD929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220124010:0":{"text":"We'll share a long, wondrous life together.","source_cn":"我们会一起度过非常漫长，非常精彩的人生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE083D817BE7335B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220124011:0":{"text":"Ahh... Ce... cilia...","source_cn":"……啊啊……塞西……莉亚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8A474A2220C5125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220124012:0":{"text":"Thank you all. Jonah and I are ready to embark on our eternal adventure.","source_cn":"善良的魔法师。谢谢你们。我和乔纳森要走了。这会是一场永...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFED8B3412C894399","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thank you all. Jonah and I are ready to embark on our eternal adventure.","female":"Thank you all. Jonah and I are ready to embark on our eternal adventure.","variant_male_record_index":"131463","variant_female_record_index":"131464","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220124013:0":{"text":"Come on, Jonah. Let's go together...","source_cn":"来吧，乔纳森，我们一起出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x768990D37259FDBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220124014:0":{"text":"...Beyond the horizon.","source_cn":"……向远方去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC3868C683C7AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:12020138:0":{"text":"Cecilia sings the song \"Bey